  (title_block (title "SnowOwl v2 - Shield") (company "YurilLAB")
    (comment 1 "ESP32-SnowOwl v2 - compact 2-board stack"))
  (lib_symbols)
  (text "ESP32-SnowOwl v2  --  SHIELD (expansion)
Organising principle: J1 (lower-centre horizontal strip) is the trunk; a
central SPI SPINE runs NORTH from it and every SPI radio TAPS OFF it (no
point-to-point runs). All antennas live on edges with their front-ends
immediately inboard. I2C branches WEST to PN532; UART branches EAST to
C5/RV1106/GPS. Big modules (nRF24 x3, RV1106) go on the BACK." (at 20 15 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid fc12b3b8-c21b-4041-930a-eb781b3f170e))
